{"uid":"5004ca13ccebaab9","name":"test_any_present_verdict_value_beside_valid_fence_skips_recovery[list]","fullName":"tests.test_worker_verdict_recovery#test_any_present_verdict_value_beside_valid_fence_skips_recovery","historyId":"b97e42651c839a206266c54fa3c5499e","time":{"start":1791976852541,"stop":1791976852568,"duration":27},"description":"cure-01-02 retry: the rule is KEY PRESENCE, not the key's value. The\n    verifier's own probe was `{\"verdict\": null}` -- a present `null` used to\n    be read as \"no verdict\" (`if verdict is None`) and took shape 1's fenced\n    recovery, emitting `contract.recovered`. Every present value -- `null`,\n    a number, an empty string, a list -- is a JSON object CARRYING `verdict`\n    and so must skip shapes 1-3 and take the generic schema ladder exactly\n    like `\"done\"` above: a `contract.violation`, never `contract.recovered`,\n    never `worker.verdict_absent`.","descriptionHtml":"<p>cure-01-02 retry: the rule is KEY PRESENCE, not the key's value. The<br />\nverifier's own probe was <code>{&quot;verdict&quot;: null}</code> -- a present <code>null</code> used to<br />\nbe read as &quot;no verdict&quot; (<code>if verdict is None</code>) and took shape 1's fenced<br />\nrecovery, emitting <code>contract.recovered</code>. Every present value -- <code>null</code>,<br />\na number, an empty string, a list -- is a JSON object CARRYING <code>verdict</code><br />\nand so must skip shapes 1-3 and take the generic schema ladder exactly<br />\nlike <code>&quot;done&quot;</code> above: a <code>contract.violation</code>, never <code>contract.recovered</code>,<br />\nnever <code>worker.verdict_absent</code>.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791976554785,"stop":1791976554785,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage